{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-43444","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-48568","text":"--- name: workflows description: Use when the user asks \"how do I use graphonomous for X?\", wants end-to-end recipes, or needs guidance on common multi-step patterns like cold start, codebase exploration, debugging, or autonomous iteration. argument-hint: [cold-start|warm-resume|question|explore|debug|ralph-loop|contradictions|maintenance|end-session|teach|handoff] ---"}]},{"id":"blk-43445","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-48569","text":"Graphonomous Workflows"}]},{"id":"blk-43446","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-48570","text":"End-to-end recipes for common tasks. Pick the workflow that matches your situation."}]},{"id":"blk-43447","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-48571","text":"Arguments"}]},{"id":"blk-43448","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-48572","text":"Workflow type: $ARGUMENTS"}]},{"id":"blk-43449","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-48573","text":"Cold Start (empty graph)"}]},{"id":"blk-43450","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-48574","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-48575","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieve(action: \"context\", query: \"project overview\")"},{"id":"spn-48576","text":" — confirm empty 2. "},{"id":"spn-48577","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"manage_goal\", operation: \"create_goal\", payload: {\"title\": \"Orient on project\", \"horizon\": \"short\"})"},{"id":"spn-48578","text":" 3. Explore code/docs → "},{"id":"spn-48579","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"store_node\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-48580","text":" for each key finding 4. Link nodes with "},{"id":"spn-48581","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"store_edge\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-48582","text":" where relationships improve retrieval 5. "},{"id":"spn-48583","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"manage_goal\", operation: \"set_progress\", goal_id: \"<id>\", progress: 0.5)"},{"id":"spn-48584","text":" 6. "},{"id":"spn-48585","marks":["code"],"text":"consolidate(action: \"run\")"}]},{"id":"blk-43451","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-48586","text":"Warm Resume (existing knowledge)"}]},{"id":"blk-43452","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-48587","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-48588","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"manage_goal\", operation: \"list_goals\", filters: {\"status\": \"active\"})"},{"id":"spn-48589","text":" 2. "},{"id":"spn-48590","marks":["code"],"text":"route(action: \"attention_survey\", include_idle: false)"},{"id":"spn-48591","text":" 3. Pick top attention item or follow user request 4. "},{"id":"spn-48592","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieve(action: \"context\", query: \"<current topic>\")"},{"id":"spn-48593","text":" 5. Continue working with context, saving "},{"id":"spn-48594","marks":["code"],"text":"causal_context"}]},{"id":"blk-43453","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-48595","text":"Answer a Question"}]},{"id":"blk-43454","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-48596","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-48597","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieve(action: \"context\", query: \"<the question>\")"},{"id":"spn-48598","text":" — save "},{"id":"spn-48599","marks":["code"],"text":"causal_context"},{"id":"spn-48600","text":" 2. Check "},{"id":"spn-48601","marks":["code"],"text":"topology.routing"},{"id":"spn-48602","text":" — if "},{"id":"spn-48603","marks":["code"],"text":"\"deliberate\""},{"id":"spn-48604","text":", run "},{"id":"spn-48605","marks":["code"],"text":"route(action: \"deliberate\", query: \"...\")"},{"id":"spn-48606","text":" 3. Optionally "},{"id":"spn-48607","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieve(action: \"coverage\", query: \"...\")"},{"id":"spn-48608","text":" for quick act/learn/escalate pre-check 4. Answer using retrieved knowledge + current conversation 5. "},{"id":"spn-48609","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"store_node\", node_type: \"semantic\", content: \"...\", source: \"conversation\")"},{"id":"spn-48610","text":" 6. If user confirms → "},{"id":"spn-48611","marks":["code"],"text":"learn(action: \"from_outcome\", status: \"success\", causal_node_ids: [...])"}]},{"id":"blk-43455","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-48612","text":"Explore a Codebase"}]},{"id":"blk-43456","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-48613","text":"1. Create parent goal: "},{"id":"spn-48614","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"manage_goal\", operation: \"create_goal\", payload: {\"title\": \"Explore <repo>\"})"},{"id":"spn-48615","text":" 2. Create sub-goals per module (3–6), each with "},{"id":"spn-48616","marks":["code"],"text":"parent_goal_id"},{"id":"spn-48617","text":" 3. For each module: explore → "},{"id":"spn-48618","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"store_node\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-48619","text":" → "},{"id":"spn-48620","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"store_edge\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-48621","text":" 4. Use "},{"id":"spn-48622","marks":["code"],"text":"consolidate(action: \"traverse\", start_node_id: \"<id>\", max_depth: 2)"},{"id":"spn-48623","text":" to walk related knowledge 5. "},{"id":"spn-48624","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"manage_goal\", operation: \"link_nodes\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-48625","text":" — link findings to sub-goals 6. "},{"id":"spn-48626","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"manage_goal\", operation: \"set_progress\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-48627","text":" after each module 7. "},{"id":"spn-48628","marks":["code"],"text":"route(action: \"review_goal\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-48629","text":" on parent when all sub-goals done"}]},{"id":"blk-43457","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-48630","text":"Debug a Problem"}]},{"id":"blk-43458","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-48631","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-48632","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieve(action: \"context\", query: \"prior context on <issue>\")"},{"id":"spn-48633","text":" — save "},{"id":"spn-48634","marks":["code"],"text":"causal_context"},{"id":"spn-48635","text":" 2. Isolate the issue using retrieved context 3. Test fix 4. "},{"id":"spn-48636","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"store_node\", node_type: \"episodic\", content: \"...\")"},{"id":"spn-48637","text":" 5. "},{"id":"spn-48638","marks":["code"],"text":"learn(action: \"from_outcome\", status: \"success\"|\"failure\", causal_node_ids: [...])"},{"id":"spn-48639","text":" with real IDs 6. Link to goal if applicable"}]},{"id":"blk-43459","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-48640","text":"Resolve Contradictions"}]},{"id":"blk-43460","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-48641","text":"1. Detect: "},{"id":"spn-48642","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieve"},{"id":"spn-48643","text":" returns nodes with "},{"id":"spn-48644","marks":["code"],"text":"contradicts"},{"id":"spn-48645","text":" edges, or "},{"id":"spn-48646","marks":["code"],"text":"routing: \"deliberate\""},{"id":"spn-48647","text":" 2. Diagnose: "},{"id":"spn-48648","marks":["code"],"text":"route(action: \"topology\", query: \"<topic>\")"},{"id":"spn-48649","text":" — examine SCCs and fault-line edges 3. Deliberate: "},{"id":"spn-48650","marks":["code"],"text":"route(action: \"deliberate\", query: \"<the contradiction>\", write_back: true)"},{"id":"spn-48651","text":" 4. Verify: "},{"id":"spn-48652","marks":["code"],"text":"route(action: \"topology\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-48653","text":" again — confirm κ decreased 5. Store resolution as semantic node if not already written back"}]},{"id":"blk-43461","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-48654","text":"Ralph Loop (autonomous iteration)"}]},{"id":"blk-43462","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-48655","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-48656","marks":["code"],"text":"route(action: \"attention_survey\")"},{"id":"spn-48657","text":" → pick top item 2. "},{"id":"spn-48658","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieve(action: \"context\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-48659","text":" for that goal — save "},{"id":"spn-48660","marks":["code"],"text":"causal_context"},{"id":"spn-48661","text":" 3. Act on it 4. "},{"id":"spn-48662","marks":["code"],"text":"learn(action: \"from_outcome\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-48663","text":" with real causal IDs 5. "},{"id":"spn-48664","marks":["code"],"text":"route(action: \"review_goal\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-48665","text":" → follow act/learn/escalate decision 6. Advance to next attention item 7. Repeat; "},{"id":"spn-48666","marks":["code"],"text":"consolidate(action: \"run\")"},{"id":"spn-48667","text":" every 4–5 cycles"}]},{"id":"blk-43463","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-48668","text":"Maintenance"}]},{"id":"blk-43464","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-48669","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-48670","marks":["code"],"text":"consolidate(action: \"stats\")"},{"id":"spn-48671","text":" — check overall graph health 2. "},{"id":"spn-48672","marks":["code"],"text":"consolidate(action: \"run\")"},{"id":"spn-48673","text":" 3. "},{"id":"spn-48674","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"manage_goal\", operation: \"list_goals\")"},{"id":"spn-48675","text":" — review all goals 4. Re-review any active goals near completion thresholds 5. Transition stale goals to "},{"id":"spn-48676","marks":["code"],"text":"suspended"},{"id":"spn-48677","text":" or "},{"id":"spn-48678","marks":["code"],"text":"abandoned"},{"id":"spn-48679","text":" with metadata"}]},{"id":"blk-43465","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-48680","text":"Teach a Domain"}]},{"id":"blk-43466","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-48681","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-48682","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"manage_goal\", operation: \"create_goal\", payload: {\"title\": \"Learn <domain>\"})"},{"id":"spn-48683","text":" 2. User provides info → "},{"id":"spn-48684","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"store_node\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-48685","text":" for each fact/procedure 3. "},{"id":"spn-48686","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"store_edge\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-48687","text":" to connect related concepts 4. "},{"id":"spn-48688","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"manage_goal\", operation: \"link_nodes\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-48689","text":" — link all nodes to goal 5. Build out recursively until coverage review returns "},{"id":"spn-48690","marks":["code"],"text":"act"}]},{"id":"blk-43467","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-48691","text":"Multi-Agent Handoff"}]},{"id":"blk-43468","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-48692","text":"1. Prepare state snapshot: "},{"id":"spn-48693","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"manage_goal\", operation: \"list_goals\")"},{"id":"spn-48694","text":" 2. For each active goal: "},{"id":"spn-48695","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"manage_goal\", operation: \"get_goal\", goal_id: \"<id>\")"},{"id":"spn-48696","text":" 3. Include linked nodes, progress, outcomes, and coverage state 4. Recipient resumes with "},{"id":"spn-48697","marks":["code"],"text":"/graphonomous:bootstrap"},{"id":"spn-48698","text":" to load context"}]},{"id":"blk-43469","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-48699","text":"End of Session"}]},{"id":"blk-43470","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-48700","text":"1. Store pending knowledge: "},{"id":"spn-48701","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"store_node\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-48702","text":" 2. Report outcomes: "},{"id":"spn-48703","marks":["code"],"text":"learn(action: \"from_outcome\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-48704","text":" 3. Update goal progress: "},{"id":"spn-48705","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"manage_goal\", operation: \"set_progress\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-48706","text":" 4. Consolidate: "},{"id":"spn-48707","marks":["code"],"text":"consolidate(action: \"run\")"}]}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaiera7nrzoiodlunzdjyucxpsrpnydn4iikic3y4dthxl2bbok4enfndq","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}